  unitName: Metal Coal Cauldron (EU)
  unitId: 710154
  unitNumber: 7084
  description: "Coal Cauldron and his gang have extended their influence as far as
    the eye can see by plundering from their neighbors and threatening the region\u2019s
    mutants. He understands his flamethrowers much better now and has spent countless
    nights perfecting them and days using them. The only thing that he hasn\u2019t
    conquered yet is Gazolina\u2019s heart..."
